# bat: Catppuccin Latte ships with bat (>= 0.25), so no theme file is vendored.
# bat resolves themes by the name inside the file, hence the quoted name.
# Plain style + no pager (equivalent to `-pp`) keep `cat` (alias -> bat)
# cat-like; decorations can still be requested per call (e.g. `bat -n`).
--theme="Catppuccin Latte"
# --style=plain
# --paging=never
